        "english": {
          "n": 4,
          "heading": "Roots Need Loose Soil, Paths Need Your Feet",
          "body": [
            "Compacted soil loses its air spaces. Roots slow down. Water soaks in differently. The bed gets harder to work every season.",
            "The protection is simple. Permanent paths, and a bed narrow enough to reach into from both sides.",
            "One metre to one point two metres wide. That's the working number. At that width you can reach the centre from either path, and your feet never touch the growing area.",
            "Now think about your own beds. Can you reach the middle without stepping inside? Go and try it before you plant anything else."
          ]
        },
        "target": {
          "heading": {
            "status": "english-hold"
          },
          "body": [
            {
              "status": "draft",
              "text": "Mavu o petetsanaho a xedza zwikhala zwa muya. Midzi i aluwa nga u ongolowa. Maḓi a nwela nga nḓila yo fhambanaho. Bed gets harder to work kha khalaṅwaha iṅwe na iṅwe."
            },
            {
              "status": "mixed",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "sourceEnglish": "The protection is simple. ",
                  "status": "draft",
                  "text": "Tsireledzo ndi yo leluwaho. "
                },
                {
                  "sourceEnglish": "Permanent paths",
                  "status": "english-hold"
                },
                {
                  "sourceEnglish": ", and a bed narrow enough to reach into from both sides.",
                  "status": "draft",
                  "text": ", na bed ine ya vha tsekene lune na nga swikelela nga ngomu ni tshi bva kha masia oṱhe mavhili."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "status": "mixed",
              "segments": [
                {
                  "sourceEnglish": "One metre to one point two metres wide.",
                  "status": "english-hold"
                },
                {
                  "sourceEnglish": " That's the working number. At that width you can reach the centre from either path, and your feet never touch the ",
                  "status": "draft",
                  "text": " Wonoyo ndi mpimo une wa shumiswa. Kha honoho vhuphara ni nga swikelela vhukati ni tshi bva kha iṅwe na iṅwe ya paths mbili, nahone milenzhe yaṋu a i kwami "
                },
                {
                  "sourceEnglish": "growing area",
                  "status": "english-hold"
                },
                {
                  "sourceEnglish": ".",
                  "status": "draft",
                  "text": " na luthihi."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "status": "draft",
              "text": "Zwino humbulani nga ha beds dzaṋu. Ni nga swikelela vhukati ni sa kande nga ngomu? Iyani ni lingedze zwenezwo ni sa athu ṱavha tshiṅwe tshithu."
            }
          ]
        }
